// Two-line exchanges for local rappers. The first line is the player's, the second the character's; each knot is one exchange.

=== greeting ===
Hey, I like the beat in your headphones. # who:player
Appreciate it. It is not done, but it is honest.
-> END

=== smalltalk ===
Working on anything new? # who:player
Sixteen bars and a hook that will not leave me alone.
-> END

=== busy ===
Got a second? # who:player
Mid-verse right now. Do not break the rhythm.
-> END

=== deflect ===
What do you think of the other crews? # who:player
I stay in my lane and make the lane louder.
-> END

=== farewell ===
Keep making noise. # who:player
Always. Catch you on the block.
-> END
